OL,3,GNEWSASame-day emergency care unit opens
OL,4,Aat hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA revamped emergency care unit is set
OL,7,Fto open at a hospital in Kent on
OL,8,FTuesday as part of plans to improve
OL,9,Fpatient flows.
OL,11,FThe Same Day Emergency Care (SDEC) unit
OL,12,Fat the Queen Elizabeth The Queen Mother
OL,13,FHospital in Margate is designed to
OL,14,Fallow specialist teams to assess,
OL,15,Fdiagnose and treat some patients on the
OL,16,Fsame day, reducing the need for
OL,17,Fadmission to a hospital ward.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
