OL,3,GNEWSASame-day emergency care unit opens
OL,4,Aat hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Kent Hospitals University NHS
OL,7,FFoundation Trust said patients with
OL,8,Fcertain conditions will be able to
OL,9,Freturn home the same day if it is
OL,10,Fclinically safe.
OL,12,FThe unit is one of two SDEC facilities
OL,13,Fthat have been developed in east Kent
OL,14,Ffollowing the approval of #28.95m in
OL,15,Ffunding from NHS England.
